<title>RUSSIA: Sberbank 1996 pre-tax profit up to 14.5 trln rbls.</title>
<headline>Sberbank 1996 pre-tax profit up to 14.5 trln rbls.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31:</p>
<p> Trln rbls		 1996	     1995</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	  14.5		4.3</p>
<p> capital		   17.5		n/a</p>
<p> savings deposits     104.3		n/a</p>
<p>NOTES - Full name is Sberegatelny Bank Rossiiskoi Federatsii. Shares are traded on second tier of Russian Trading System (RTS-2)  PAUFOR12. Other figures will be released end-May or early June.</p>
<p>Sberbank's investment in government securities at the beginning of the year was 84.9 trillion roubles (56.2 percent of assets).</p>
<p>The Central Bank owns 50 percent plus one share in Sberbank. Other major shareholders include Tokobank and Vneshtorgbank Rossii.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
